 Je komt aan in de noordelijke haven van Cormaya, bij {npc:Pemaret}, die je terugbrengt naar Edron ({key:hi}, {key:edron}, {key:yes})."],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"map","marks",0,"label"],"fc80187fa85d085d","Ten noorden van Cormaya Flats"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"map","marks",1,"label"],"c5be95af97f08b39","Bij de vijver"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"map","marks",2,"label"],"d2ef7db4605ccf38","Ten westen van de mijnen, onder een boom"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"map","marks",3,"label"],"373ac2b05419cff2","Ten oosten van de mijnen"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"map","marks",4,"label"],"207f58142c97f65c","Onder een boom"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","head",2],"e45951136f06bb35","Coördinaat"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","rows",0,1],"fc80187fa85d085d","Ten noorden van Cormaya Flats"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","rows",1,1],"5537cdc73009553d","Bij de vijver (swimming hole)"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","rows",2,1],"ecf91e68de99265a","Ten westen van de dwergenmijnen, onder een boom"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","rows",3,1],"bd5a2d8c682f9594","Ten oosten van de dwergenmijnen"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","rows",4,1],"207f58142c97f65c","Onder een boom"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"text"],"f46fda523176df6a","De 5 nesten van **Fibula**: Fibula ligt ten zuiden van Thais: je komt er te voet via de tunnel die ten zuiden van Thais begint ({coord:32261,32385,7}) en gaat via dezelfde tunnel terug."],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"map","marks",1,"label"],"030929feecc64292","Westelijk strand"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"map","marks",2,"label"],"241281c603eeced0","Ten oosten van de Clanhall van Fibula"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"map","marks",3,"label"],"0665c81bec8ff90f","Oostelijk strand"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"map","marks",4,"label"],"47606240157c271a","Ten noorden van de dorpsbar"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"table","head",2],"e45951136f06bb35","Coördinaat"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"table","rows",1,1],"030929feecc64292","Westelijk strand"],[["sections",1,"steps",